pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-sep
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [0, 40, 1280, 2]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 50, 500, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>研究背景与问题空间</p>

  - elementId: intro-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 1160, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>物联网及网络设备的Web接口是对外暴露的主要通信接口，传统分析工具在IoT Web固件上面临四大挑战。</p>

  - elementId: challenge-bg-1
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [5000]
    bounds: [60, 160, 275, 170]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: challenge-icon-1
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 175, 28, 28]
    iconName: "far:dot-circle"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: challenge-title-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 215, 235, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>入口识别难</strong></p>

  - elementId: challenge-desc-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 250, 235, 55]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>缺乏源码，传统工具难以定位后端二进制程序真实的污点源</p>

  - elementId: challenge-bg-2
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [5000]
    bounds: [355, 160, 275, 170]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: challenge-icon-2
